## Worth an editor pass
The Muse Code contributor tier and the new Remotasks material now rhyme hard — both are "cheap access in exchange for your judgment." I left that implicit rather than having the ending state it. An editor should decide whether the close names the parallel or trusts the reader. Also, Scale's response to the *Washington Post* piece specifically wasn't verified (only its Rest of World response is quoted), so I scoped the body language to what I could confirm.
